        🐻 kept part❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕decoded
    🔂 part kept 🍇
      ↪️ 🧹🐇🧰 part❗️ ➡️ text 🍇
